 • INC R0/R1 (3,4): Basic increment + overflow wrapping
 • DEC R0/R1 (5,6): Basic decrement + underflow wrapping
 • NOP (7): No operation verification
 • OUTPUT (8): Single digit (1 char) and double digit (2 chars) output
 • LOAD R0/R1 (9,10): Memory to register loading
 • STORE R0/R1 (11,12): Register to memory storing
 • JMP (13): Unconditional jumps
 • JZ (14): Jump when zero + no jump when non-zero
 • JNZ (15): Jump when non-zero + no jump when zero

                     Complete Program Testing (6 tests):

 • Simple Counter: Sequential instruction execution with termination
 • Output Program: Multi-instruction output testing
 • Arithmetic Program: Memory operations, arithmetic, and storage
 • Conditional Jump - Zero: Jump behavior when condition is met
 • Conditional Jump - Non-Zero: Jump behavior when condition is not met
 • Simple Loop: Infinite loop detection with proper timeout handling

